  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Operation and Management Strategy (dated: 06/01/2025)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pre-existing and Existing Elevations (drawing no: 2, received: 20/08/2024)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pre-existing and Existing Floor Plans (drawing no: 1, received: 20/08/2024)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Design and Access Statement (received: 20/08/2024)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Existing and Proposed Block Plan (dated: 16/08/2024)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Site Location Plan (dated: 20/08/2024)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;No other drawings or documents apply.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing dwellinghouse.<br></p>",
    "The supported accommodation home hereby approved shall be occupied by no more than 4 children at any one time without prior permission of the Local Planning Authority.&nbsp;",
    "Cycle\r\nParking Details and Implementation&nbsp;(a)&nbsp;\r\nPrior to first use, details including the design and location of all cycle parking spaces&nbsp;shall be submitted to and approved in\r\nwriting by the Local Planning authority. All cycle storage should be designed\r\nand laid out in accordance with the guidance contained in the London Cycling\r\nDesign Standards. (b)&nbsp;\r\nThe approved details\r\nshall be implemented prior to first use of the development and thereafter\r\npermanently retained for the lifetime of the development. "
  ],
